From: Gooder24 <162874774+Gooder24@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:17:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] connector: a contact's about text for Weft, and statuses stay
 unseen

GET /_matrix/provision/v3/weft/profile/{userID} answers {about, fetched_at}: the usync "status" query the phone
makes when a contact's info opens (nobody is notified), cached an hour per person, at least 2 s between queries.

Nothing in the status broadcast room reaches the poster: no read receipt (it would put the user among the
status's viewers), no typing, no media retry receipt. Sending and reacting were already refused there.

Build on asus (v26.10, encryption is off there):
  copy whatsmeow v0.0.0-20261016130820-0b0a1cdac3e2 to ../whatsmeow, git apply whatsmeow-status-stanza.patch in it
  go mod edit -replace go.mau.fi/whatsmeow=../whatsmeow
  go build -tags goolm -o mautrix-whatsapp ./cmd/mautrix-whatsapp
